==English==

===Etymology===
Latin for ''he is ill'', form of the verb ''[[aegrotare]]''.

===Noun===
'''aegrotat'''[[Category:English nouns that lack inflection template]]

# A certificate indicating that a student is ill, excusing him or her from lectures and examinations and allowing him to pass courses for which he is too ill to finish the required materials.

